#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:47
msgid ""
"This effect/filter overlays a timer onto the video. The timer can count up "
"or down."
msgstr ""
"Tento efekt/filter prekrýva časovač na video. Časovač môže odpočítavať nahor "
"alebo nadol."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:51
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Parametre"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:58
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "Parameter"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:59
msgid "Value"
msgstr "Hodnota"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:61
msgid "Font Family / Style / Size / Weight"
msgstr "Rodina písma / Štýl / Veľkosť / Hrúbka"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:62
msgid "Selection / Integer"
msgstr "Výber / Celé číslo"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:63
msgid ""
"Select the font and its attributes for the text. **Font Weight** seems to "
"behave differently depending on the selected font family."
msgstr ""
"Vyberte písmo a jeho atribúty pre text. **Hrúbka písma** sa zdá správať "
"odlišne v závislosti od vybranej rodiny písma."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:64
msgid "Outline Width"
msgstr "Šírka obrysu"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:65
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:68
msgid "Integer"
msgstr "Celé číslo"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:66
msgid "Set the width of the outline in pixels to 0, 1, 2 or 3"
msgstr "Nastaví šírku obrysu v pixeloch na 0, 1, 2 alebo 3"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:67
msgid "Padding"
msgstr "Výplň"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:69
msgid ""
"The number of pixels to pad the background rectangle beyond the edges of text"
msgstr "Počet pixelov pre odsadenie obdĺžnika pozadia za okraje textu"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:70
msgid "Horizontal / Vertical Alignment"
msgstr "Horizontálne / Vertikálne zarovnanie"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:71
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:74
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:86
msgid "Selection"
msgstr "Výber"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:72
msgid "Set the horizontal and vertical alignment within the geometry rectangle"
msgstr ""
"Nastaví horizontálne a vertikálne zarovnanie v rámci geometrického obdĺžnika"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:73
msgid "Format"
msgstr "Formát"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:75
msgid "The time format of the timer text"
msgstr "Časový formát textu časovača"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:76
msgid "Start"
msgstr "Spustiť"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:77
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:80
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:83
msgid "Slider"
msgstr "Posuvník"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:78
msgid ""
"The time that the timer will start counting up or down. The text will be "
"frozen at 00:00:00.000 from the start of the filter until the start time has "
"elapsed."
msgstr ""
"Čas, od ktorého začne časovač odpočítavať nahor alebo nadol. Text bude "
"zmrazený na 00:00:00.000 od začiatku filtra až do uplynutia počiatočného "
"času."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:79
msgid "Duration"
msgstr "Trvanie"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:81
msgid ""
"The maximum elapsed duration of the timer after the start time has elapsed. "
"The text will be frozen at the duration time after the duration has elapsed."
msgstr ""
"Maximálna uplynulá dĺžka časovača po uplynutí počiatočného času. Text bude "
"zmrazený na hodnote dĺžky po jej uplynutí."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:82
msgid "Offset"
msgstr "Posun"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:84
msgid ""
"An offset to be added to the timer value. When the direction is \"down\", "
"the timer will count down to \"offset\" instead of 00:00:00.000. When the "
"direction is up, the timer will count up starting from \"offset\"."
msgstr ""
"Posun, ktorý sa pripočíta k hodnote časovača. Keď je smer „nadol\", časovač "
"bude odpočítavať do hodnoty „posun\" namiesto 00:00:00.000. Keď je smer "
"nahor, časovač bude odpočítavať nahor počnúc od hodnoty „posun\"."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:85
msgid "Direction"
msgstr "Smer"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:87
msgid ""
"Whether the counter should count **up** from 00:00:00.000 or **down** from "
"the duration time."
msgstr ""
"Či má počítadlo odpočítavať **nahor** od 00:00:00.000 alebo **nadol** od "
"hodnoty dĺžky."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:88
msgid "X / Y / W / H / Size / Opacity"
msgstr "X / Y / Š / V / Veľkosť / Nepriehľadnosť"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:89
msgid "Integer / Percent"
msgstr "Celé číslo / Percento"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:90
msgid ""
"X and Y coordinates, Width and Height, Size and Opacity of the overlay "
"rectangle. You can use these parameters to fine tune the position, size and :"
"term:`opacity` of the overlay."
msgstr ""
"Súradnice X a Y, šírka a výška, veľkosť a :term:`opacity` obdĺžnika "
"prekrytia. Tieto parametre môžete použiť na jemné doladenie polohy, veľkosti "
"a nepriehľadnosti prekrytia."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:91
msgid "Foreground / Background / Outline Color"
msgstr "Farba popredia / pozadia / obrysu"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:92
msgid "Picker"
msgstr "Výberník"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/timer.rst:93
msgid ""
"Specify the colors for the text (foreground), the background rectangle "
"defined by :guilabel:`Padding` and the outline color (if :guilabel:`Outline "
"Width` is greater than 0)."
msgstr ""
"Zadajte farby pre text (popredí), obdĺžnik pozadia definovaný parametrom :"
"guilabel:`Padding` a farbu obrysu (ak je :guilabel:`Outline Width` väčšia "
"ako 0)."

